  abilityNotes: "IMPLEMENTED (SunAbility). Correctly has no base Attack stat \u2014
    its strike isn't lane-based, so wiring one would add a wrong second attack. Each
    Combat phase it deals damage equal to its CURRENT HP to the enemy unit with the
    highest HP, which produces the decaying nuke its design note describes (6, then
    5, then 4) for free, with no stored power to keep in sync. If the enemy has no
    units it does nothing \u2014 the card gives it no Soul damage to fall back on.
    DISPEL SCOPE, flagged: 'cancels all illusions, stealth, and armor' is implemented
    as cancelling The Moon's miss chance only, that being the sole concealment effect
    the simulation has. Deliberately NOT extended to Strength's damage immunity or
    The Devil's Soul immunity, tempting as 'armor' sounds \u2014 those are the whole
    identity of their cards rather than a status layered on top, and cancelling them
    would rewrite two cards from one word in a third."
